iio: aop_als: report the sensor's colour temperature

The VD6286 ("Redbird") report carries the AOP's correlated colour
temperature as an f32 at 0x45, next to lux at 0x28; macOS 13.5's
AppleSPUVD6286 reads it there into the HID event's CCT, which True Tone
uses. Register it as a second IIO device, aop-sensors-als-cct
(in_colortemp_input, K), fed by the same report: the AOP hands a
service's reports to its first listener only, so one listener serves both.

